<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<TXSPN>I decided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll confirm the truth of the matter with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my hypothesis is wrong, that's fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm calling to make sure that it's wrong.<PG>
That's right, with feelings like these, I can't possibly investigate properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll rule out the possibility that <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is involved, and get serious about investigating the incident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It'd be best to start with casual talk, and partway through, ask a question meant to trip her up.<PG>
When I lifted my face from where I'd been lying face down, 
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
my smartphone was lying right by my pillow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hand was shaking. Could I make casual talk in this state?<PG>
I got up, stood in front of the mirror, and tried grinning from ear to ear as hard as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yeah, I'm okay.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took one big, deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, time to carry out the Operation.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
